Source: pg-icu-parser
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), libicu-dev, pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/IgKh/pg_icu_parser

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-icu-parser
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-pg-icu-parser
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: PostgreSQL text search parser using ICU boundary analysis for PostgreSQL PGVERSION
 pg_icu_parser provides the icu_parser text search parser using ICU word
 boundary analysis. It supports multilingual tokenization and a configurable
 ICU locale. The ts_headline function is not supported.
